# RECORDS (pak flow): START GAME DOWN x1 = RECORDS (rows TOTALS, CONTROLLER PAK n, players or NO PLAYERS);
# TOTALS (A): TRACK / STATS rows, RIGHT cycles tracks (TRACK 1, TRACK 1 BACKWARD, TRACK 2, ...), DOWN + RIGHT the stats
# pages; B back. With saves.press's pak (--pak FILE) the players row lists the saved player.
frames 1200
pak on
4 START
7 DOWN
9 A
12 A
15 RIGHT
17 RIGHT
19 DOWN
21 RIGHT
23 RIGHT
26 B
28 DOWN
29 DOWN
31 A
35 B
